34:Reading any readable port (PPUSTATUS, OAMDATA, or PPUDATA) also fills the latch with the bits read.
35-Reading a nominally "write-only" register returns the latch's current value, as do the unused bits of PPUSTATUS.
36-At least one bit in this value decays after 3ms to 30ms, faster when the PPU is warm. [[2]](#cite_note-2)
